---
title: Auth - Logout Flow (POST /auth/logout)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Ctrl as AuthController
    participant Service as AuthService
    participant RefreshTokenModel as RefreshTokenModel (TypeORM Repository)
    participant Util as Security Utils (bcrypt / crypto / jwt)
    participant DB as Database (SQL Server)

    note right of Client: POST /auth/logout
    Client->>Ctrl: RefreshTokenDto (refreshToken)
    Ctrl->>Service: logout(dto)
    Service->>Util: hashToken(refreshToken) (SHA-256)
    Util-->>Service: tokenHash
    Service->>RefreshTokenModel: findOne({ tokenHash })
    RefreshTokenModel->>DB: SELECT * FROM RefreshTokens WHERE TokenHash = ?
    DB-->>RefreshTokenModel: row / null
    RefreshTokenModel-->>Service: RefreshToken Entity / null
    opt If RefreshToken found
        Service->>RefreshTokenModel: remove(record)
        RefreshTokenModel->>DB: DELETE FROM RefreshTokens WHERE Id = ?
        DB-->>RefreshTokenModel: ok
    end
    Service-->>Ctrl: MessageResponseDto (message)
    Ctrl-->>Client: HTTP 200 - MessageResponseDto